# Copyright (c) 2026 AaaS Contributors
#
# Component:       digit-0
# Module:          .clang-tidy
# Owning Team:     Arithmetic Excellence Center (AEC)
# Classification:  INTERNAL
# Purpose:         Static analysis rules of the C sources (clang-tidy 20),
#                  run by the lint stage; every finding is an error.
# Related Docs:    services/digit-0/Dockerfile, ADR-0022
#
# Disabled checks and why:
#   clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling:
#     flags every snprintf/memcpy/memset; all writes here are bounded by
#     the destination size, which the check cannot see.
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: the HTTP handler signature is
#     fixed by libmicrohttpd.
Checks: >-
  clang-diagnostic-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  misc-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -misc-include-cleaner
WarningsAsErrors: "*"
